@startuml 4.2.2_sequence_diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

autonumber
actor "Farmer" as Farmer
actor "Trader" as Trader
actor "Exporter" as Exporter
actor "International\nBuyer" as Buyer
boundary "React.js Frontend\n(CardaLink UI)" as UI
control "Django REST API\n(Backend Controller)" as API
database "PostgreSQL DB\n(cardalink_db)" as DB

== 1. Harvest Logging & Marketplace Listing ==
Farmer -> UI: Record Harvest (fresh kg, dry kg, grade, variety)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/harvests/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO harvest_records & inventory_items
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created (batch_code: BAT-2026-FARM-101)
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Harvest recorded & inventory updated
deactivate API
UI --> Farmer: Display success notification
deactivate UI

Farmer -> UI: Post Lot to Domestic Marketplace
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/marketplace/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO marketplace_listings (status='AVAILABLE')
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created (listing_id)
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Listing published
deactivate API
UI --> Farmer: Listing Active
deactivate UI

== 2. Trader Procurement & Handover ==
Trader -> UI: Browse Marketplace & Submit Purchase Request
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/purchase-requests/ (qty, price)
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO purchase_requests (status='PENDING')
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created (request_id)
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Purchase Request Sent
deactivate API
UI --> Trader: Order Pending Farmer Acceptance
deactivate UI

Trader -> UI: Settle Order Payment (Razorpay / Cash)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/purchase-requests/{id}/pay/
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE purchase_requests (payment_status='PAID')
activate DB
DB --> API: 200 OK
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Payment Confirmed
deactivate API
UI --> Trader: Payment Acknowledged
deactivate UI

Farmer -> UI: Confirm Stock Handover
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/purchase-requests/{id}/confirm-handover/
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE purchase_requests (handover_confirmed=TRUE)
activate DB
DB --> API: 200 OK
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Handover Logged
deactivate API
UI --> Farmer: Handover Recorded
deactivate UI

Trader -> UI: Confirm Physical Stock Pickup
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/purchase-requests/{id}/confirm-pickup/
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE purchase_requests (pickup_confirmed=TRUE, status='COMPLETED')
activate DB
API -> DB: INSERT INTO inventory_items (owner=Trader, batch_code)
DB --> API: Stock Transferred to Trader Inventory
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Pickup Confirmed & Inventory Transferred
deactivate API
UI --> Trader: Stock in Trader Warehouse
deactivate UI

== 3. International Export Order & Compliance ==
Exporter -> UI: Create Export Order (Buyer, Incoterms, USD value, Port)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/export-orders/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO export_orders (status='CONFIRMED')
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created (EXP-ORD-B8363043)
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Export Contract Initialized
deactivate API
UI --> Exporter: Order Created
deactivate UI

Exporter -> UI: Request Supply from Trader Inventory
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/export-supplies/
activate API
API -> DB: Transfer Lot to Exporter Inventory
activate DB
DB --> API: 200 OK
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Batch Allocated to Export Order
deactivate API
UI --> Exporter: Batch Reserved
deactivate UI

Exporter -> UI: Submit Lab Quality Inspection (Moisture <= 11%, 8mm Bold)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/quality-records/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO quality_records (quality_status='APPROVED')
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Quality Standard Approved
deactivate API
UI --> Exporter: Quality Verification Passed
deactivate UI

Exporter -> UI: Upload Regulatory Compliance Documents (Phytosanitary, Origin, Invoice)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/export-documents/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO export_documents (status='VERIFIED')
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Export Clearances Verified
deactivate API
UI --> Exporter: Documents Ready
deactivate UI

== 4. Shipment Tracking & Buyer Delivery Confirmation ==
Exporter -> UI: Dispatch Shipment (Carrier, Tracking #, Departure Port)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/shipments/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO shipment_records (status='SHIPPED')
activate DB
API -> DB: UPDATE export_orders (status='SHIPPED')
DB --> API: 200 OK
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Shipment Tracking Active
deactivate API
UI --> Exporter: Cargo In Transit
deactivate UI

Exporter -> UI: Send Secure Delivery Token Link
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/export-orders/{id}/send-delivery-token/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO buyer_delivery_tokens (token_hash, expires_at)
activate DB
DB --> API: 201 Created
deactivate DB
API -> API: Dispatch Tokenized Confirmation Email to Buyer
API --> UI: Confirmation Link Sent
deactivate API
UI --> Exporter: Notification Dispatched
deactivate UI

Buyer -> UI: Open Tokenized Confirmation Link
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/delivery-confirmations/{token}/
activate API
API -> DB: Validate Token & Fetch Order Details
activate DB
DB --> API: Token Valid & Order Details
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Display Cargo Details & Confirmation Form
deactivate API
UI --> Buyer: Present Confirmation Portal
deactivate UI

Buyer -> UI: Submit Confirmation (Condition: GOOD, Receipt Upload)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/delivery-confirmations/{token}/confirm/
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO buyer_delivery_confirmations
activate DB
API -> DB: UPDATE buyer_delivery_tokens (is_used=TRUE)
API -> DB: UPDATE export_orders (status='COMPLETED')
DB --> API: 200 OK (Contract Complete)
deactivate DB
API --> UI: Delivery Successfully Confirmed
deactivate API
UI --> Buyer: Confirmation Receipt Displayed
deactivate UI
@enduml